@startuml
title Validation Evidence Flow
actor Owner
component "PowerShell orchestrator" as Runner
component "Static validators" as Static
component "Runtime probe" as Probe
component "Playwright" as Browser
database "runtime/validation/<timestamp>" as Evidence
component "Redaction control" as Redact
artifact "VALIDATION_REPORT.md" as Report
Owner -> Runner : invoke full validation
Runner -> Static
Runner -> Probe
Runner -> Browser
Static --> Evidence : logs
Probe --> Evidence : runtime-probes.json
Browser --> Evidence : screenshots/traces
Evidence -> Redact
Redact -> Report
Report --> Owner : pass/fail gate
@enduml
